# accel_test.tcyr — the DRM accel class walk, the Cerebras and Graphcore
# detectors and the interconnect pass (2.5.5), on fake sysfs, /dev and tool
# trees this unit builds under /tmp and removes, and the parsers behind them.
# Linux only: the tool tests run this binary again as a child
# (/proc/self/exe) with PATH set to a directory of fake tools.

